 da: angular width (degrees), \n#      v: median velocity (km/s)\n#     dv: variation (1 sigma) of velocity over the width of the CME\n#   minv: lowest velocity detected within the CME\n#   maxv: highest velocity detected within the CME\n#  halo?: II if da>90, III if da>180, IV if da>270, indicating potential halo/partial halo CME\n# \n  </PRE>\n <td valign='top'>\n  <PRE>\n# CME |          t0    | dt0| pa | da |  v  |  dv | minv| maxv| halo?\n  <a href=\"CME0024/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0024</a>|2026/07/20 14:00| 07 | 270| 094| 0379| 0103| 0182| 0632|  II\n  <a href=\"CME0023/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0023</a>|2026/07/20 12:12| 02 | 063| 024| 0247| 0162| 0163| 0580|    \n  <a href=\"CME0022/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0022</a>|2026/07/20 02:00| 02 | 227| 076| 0319| 0039| 0235| 0400|    \n  <a href=\"CME0021/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0021</a>|2026/07/20 01:36| 02 | 292| 014| 0274| 0038| 0226| 0329|    \n  <a href=\"CME0020/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0020</a>|2026/07/19 21:24| 02 | 283| 012| 1562| 0168| 1201| 1633|    \n  <a href=\"CME0019/CME.html\" target=\"_blank\" >0019</a>|2026/07/19 18:24| 01 | 315| 016| 033"
